#. ~ Snippet in category "blood_addiction"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid "You need blood to survive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "blood_addiction"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid "A blood spattered charnel room flashes in front of your eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "blood_addiction"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid "You lick your teeth thinking about blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "blood_addiction_dream"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You dream of sneaking into a home through an open window late at night.  "
"Walking through the darkened hallways, unerringly finding your way to a "
"bedroom.  You stand at the foot of the bed staring down at the person "
"sleeping in it.  Are they a man, woman or child?  You can't tell, all you "
"know is they are filled with blood and you need it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "blood_addiction_dream"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid ""
"In your dream, an early evening storm begins with you outside.  You feel the "
"rain hitting you but it is thicker than water, more viscous.  You smell it "
"first, before you look at your hands and realize the rain is blood.  You lean"
" your head back and open your mouth wide to the rain falling into it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "blood_addiction_dream"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You float above a house late at night watching someone enter through an open "
"window.  You blink and you are now in a bedroom seeing a disturbing scene.  "
"Someone who's face is shadowed where you can't see them is standing over a "
"person lying on the bed.  You startle when you realize that you are the "
"person lying on the bed.  You scream helplessly as the shadowed person bites "
"into sleeping you's throat and blood sprays across the room.  You wake as "
"your struggles slow and lessen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "lotus_addiction"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid "You are sure you saw movement at the edge of your vision."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "lotus_addiction"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid ""
"The hair on the back of your neck rises as you hear a voice you remember from"
" just out of sight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "lotus_addiction"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Your eye twitches on it's own for several minutes.  From the top corner near "
"your temple down into the cheek."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "lotus_addiction_dream"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You dream about watching TV, it's a documentary about some bioweapon that got"
" loose in Newfoundland.  A doctor is talking about how containment failed and"
" health campaigns failed to eradicate it.  You recognize the voice, it's your"
" voice.  As the credits play you see listed '<full_name> M.D.'  This seems "
"worrying."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "lotus_addiction_dream"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You dream of walking down a long hallway with no definite beginning or end, "
"portraits and mirrors alternate on the sides of the hallway.  Slowly you have"
" a sneaking suspicion that your reflections aren't quite reflecting you.  "
"Sometimes you spot out of the corner of your eyes distorted features, a mouth"
" full of sharp teeth, different hair styles and colors, even horns.  Each "
"time you turn and look though it's just your own reflection looking back at "
"you.  You try one last time to catch your reflection and while you are "
"staring into its eyes, you see the pupils track towards the portrait "
"reflected behind you.  You turn your eyes to focus on the portrait reflection"
" and there you are climbing out of the portrait mouth agape, full of too many"
" needle sharp teeth, you quickly focus back at your reflection in the mirror "
"and see only clear glass.  Before you can turn you feel a sharp pain in your "
"shoulder."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "lotus_addiction_dream"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/addiction_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You lounge in sunny glades, eating lotus blossoms while others frolic through"
" the breeze.  You wake feeling calmer than normal and go back to less "
"pleasant sleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"One more to kill.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"Your blood will contribute to a great cause, the end of all vampires.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"I've slain thousands, each stronger than you.  Do not believe that you can "
"kill me.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"It is all necessary, yet they all failed to understand.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"They tried to stop me, so I killed them all.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Most hunters are siding with the vampires.  I know as they tried to kill "
"me, calling me a vampire.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"Standing against me is standing against humanity.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"So thirsty… Need to drink…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"I'll send you where you belong!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"The mentors still elude me.  You however, do not.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"Vampires cannot truly be bargained with.  They must all die.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"Never trust a vampire.  It will leave you open to their mind control.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"Why did they hated me?  I only wanted to help them!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"Their blood was so delicious.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"I need your blood!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"They aren't uniting against me aren't they?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm just trying to kill all the vampires, and everyone trying to oppose me "
"in this goal.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"I can't understand why vampire hunters could want me dead.  I'm one of "
"them!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"They have started to attack me with the vampires' help!  Traitors, all of "
"them!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_vampire_anathema
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/anathema_snippets.json
msgid "\"Every other vampire will die, then I'll get rid of the last one.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_fetch_child
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/changeling_speech.json
msgid "\"Won't you take me home with you?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"You should be sleeping by now!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"You should be sleeping by now.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm going to eat you!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"SLEEP!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"Jump in my bag, it will be less painful that way.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"Another one awake past its bedtime.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"Those who do not sleep won't ever wake up.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm going to beat you until you sleep, one way or another.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"This time is for the sleeping, not for the wakeful.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"There is no excuse.  You sleep, or you die.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"I am here to guard the sleepers.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"I am here to kill the awake.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"I won't let you wake them up.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"They say being dead is akin to being asleep.  Sleep now, or you'll know "
"what is it to be dead.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"So hungry.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"Need to eat.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"Their flesh and dreams are rotten.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"You will be fine food.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"The wakeful threaten the sleepers.  I cannot let that be.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"It is currently the sleepers' time.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"All who are awake during the sleepers' time are mine.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"I wish for all to sleep well in this time.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"You are still able to sleep.  Why do you squander this gift?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"I will ensure that all who sleep won't be disturbed.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"I will ensure that all who cannot sleep will die.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_sevenoclock_active
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/cryptid_speech.json
msgid "\"For the last time: SLEEP!\""
msgstr ""

