msgid ""
"*A half-hour-long tape that films a static building in the middle of nowhere "
"with a bright, clean sky in the background.  The building is tall, thick, and"
" covered in some white mush, while the windows move in a zigzag pattern.  "
"Twenty minutes later, the camera captures a heavy aircraft that starts to "
"move in circles around the building.  In a few minutes, a massive volley "
"erupted from the plane, which made the building rip and burn apart, and its "
"dwellers - small spike-like creatures that move by rolling - quickly ran "
"away, screaming in piercing shrieks while their white spikes melted.*"
